  "insights": [
   "Phase 2b AIRCULES data for lunsekimig in moderate-to-severe asthma show efficacy largely in line with AstraZeneca's Tezspire on FEV1, though exacerbation reduction appears lower.",
   "Lunsekimig 300mg Q4W demonstrated a 55.3% reduction in annualized asthma exacerbation rate (AAER) versus placebo, compared to the 61-71% benefit seen in Tezspire's Phase 2b study.",
